---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Zenith Line website privacy policy.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="LEGAL" title="Privacy Policy" text="How information submitted through this website and its WhatsApp enquiry links is handled." crumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Privacy' }]} />
  <section class="section"><div class="container legal-copy"><p>Last updated: 1 September 2026.</p><h2>Information You Provide</h2><p>The website may collect information you choose to enter into an enquiry form, including your name, company, mobile number, location, selected service and project requirement. The form creates a WhatsApp message for you to review and send. Zenith Line does not receive the message until you send it in WhatsApp.</p><h2>Communication</h2><p>Information sent through WhatsApp, telephone or email is used to respond to your enquiry, clarify requirements and prepare related proposals or quotations.</p><h2>Analytics</h2><p>The website may use privacy-conscious traffic and conversion measurement to understand page usage and enquiry actions. Personal project descriptions should not be placed in analytics event labels.</p><h2>Third-Party Services</h2><p>WhatsApp and any enabled analytics services operate under their own terms and privacy policies. Opening an external link takes you to the relevant third-party service.</p><h2>Your Choices</h2><p>You may contact Zenith Line to ask about personal information previously submitted through a direct enquiry. Applicable retention and deletion requirements may depend on contractual or legal obligations.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For questions about this policy, email <a class="text-link" href="mailto:info@zenithlinekw.com">info@zenithlinekw.com <span>→</span></a>.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
